         <Name>Stokes I, Q, U, and V Images</Name>
         <ParameterKey>HDU:0</ParameterKey>
         <Description>Three-dimensional Level 0 SOT-FG NFI shuttered full-Stokes image data stored in the FITS Primary HDU. The first two array dimensions represent spatial image coordinates, and the third dimension contains four image planes for Stokes I, Q, U, and V. Observations are made in selected discrete NFI spectral-line passbands rather than across a continuous wavelength range; the selected passband is indicated by the FITS header keyword WAVE.</Description>
